DESCRIPTION:Don't want your fan anymore? Grew out of your old coat? Look n
 o further! Join the Community Programmers in the Blanton Atrium for the 2
 nd Annual Move Out Market! Here\, you can drop off housing items (like de
 corations\, fans\, microwaves\, etc.)\, school items (backpacks\, textboo
 ks\, supplies)\, clothing\, and non perishable food. Then\, you can shop 
 for pre-loved free items you might need for next semester! All students a
 re welcome\, commuters need to be signed in with a resident following Res
 idence Life guest registration procedures.\n\nHosted by: Residence Life\n
 \nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.co
 m/engage/event/12307243
