 ad. We’ll also have free food and drinks after our screening!\nFOCUS is a
  bi-annual multimedia collaboration produced by Montclair State and the C
 ollege of Communication and Media’s student media organizations. Every se
 mester a student-led team designates a "focus" related pressing modern-da
 y topics. Organizations include the student newspaper The Montclarion\, t
 he student radio station WMSC 90.3\, the student news show Montclair News
  Lab\, and more. \nMontclair Ad Club is proud to be the official host of 
 FOCUS’s Spring 2026 watch party. \n\nHosted by: Montclair Ad Club \n\nAdd
