DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the end of the semester with this brilliant showcase
  from our rising Visual Arts graduates! This exhibition marks the culmina
 tion of their degree\, launching their creative journeys. Each student pr
 esents a cohesive body of artwork in the Finley Galleries\, our final exh
 ibition of the Spring 2026 semester.\nMade to be Seen features an impress
 ive range of interdisciplinary approaches: mixed-media sculpture\, large-
 scale painting\, hand-sewn textiles\, ceramics\, video projection\, photo
 graphy\, and installations. Over 30 Visual Arts graduates invite you to e
 xplore their creative research and current perspectives\, on view through
  these vibrant capstone projects!  \nExhibiting Artists:Section 1: Veroni
 ca Avignone\, Christian Campoverde\, Mae Elkovich\, Lisette Flor\, Emily 
 Garces\, Aj Malabunga\, Jenna Mcdonough\, Melanie Medina\, Angeline Ortiz
 \, Tasir Plant\nSection 2: Mari Ahmed\, Chez Amos\, Kaila Craig\, Amanda 
 Lerner\, Jeremiah Molin\, Kevin Pena\, Rose Perez Cruz\, Emmanuella Ponzi
 o\, Daniel Portillo\, Liliana Salce\, Giacomo Valerin\, Beyza Yildiz\nSec
