 Katelin Guaman\, Paulina Guerra\, Keita Mcfarlane\, Teiona Mcnair\, Luz P
 lata\, Diana Valdes\, Lloyd Zheng\nMade to be SeenBA Visual Arts Thesis E
 xhibitionFinley Gallery\, Finley HallExhibition dates: April 23-29\, 2026
 Closing Reception: Wednesday April 29\, 6-8pm\n\nHosted by: Art and Desig
 n\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs
 .com/engage/event/12433037
